            <description><![CDATA[
                            <h2 style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 4px;">What's New in TK-mac</h2>
                            <p style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; color: #666; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 16px;">Helping you keep your Mac fast and healthy.</p>

                            <div style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; background: #fff5eb; border: 1px solid #ffe3cb; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 16px;">
                                <b style="color: #e67e22;">⚠️ Pro Mode Not Loading?</b> If Pro Mode is not loading after this update, please navigate to the <b>Help</b> menu in the top menu bar, select <b>TK-mac Help</b>, and follow the provided instructions.
                            </div>

                            <ul style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6;">
                                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
                                    <b>⏱️ Built-in Speed Test:</b> Accurately measure your internet performance directly from the dashboard, powered securely by M-Lab's open-source infrastructure.
                                </li>
                                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
                                    <b>🌐 Network Menu Bar:</b> Keep an eye on your live upload and download speeds, straight from your Mac's menu bar.
                                </li>
                                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
                                    <b>🔒 Remote Mac Locking:</b> You can now instantly lock your computer remotely using your phone via the remote access dashboard.
                                </li>
                                <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">
                                    <b>✨ UI Polish & Bug Fixes:</b> Refined dashboard visual elements for a cleaner native experience, and squashed several under-the-hood bugs to improve overall app stability.
                                </li>
                            </ul>

                            <p style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; color: #444; margin-top: 16px;">Thank you for your continued feedback, which helps us make TK-mac the best it can be.</p>
                        ]]></description>
